msgid "Run the following script to execute PD-colocated online inference."
msgstr "运行以下脚本以执行 PD 混部在线推理。"

msgid ""
"- `--max-model-len` specifies the maximum context length - that is, the sum of input and output tokens for a single request. Adjust it according to your actual scenario.\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs` indicates the maximum number of requests that each DP group is allowed to process. If the number of requests sent to the service exceeds this limit, the excess requests will remain in a waiting state and will not be scheduled. Note that the time spent in the waiting state is also counted in metrics such as TTFT and TPOT. Therefore, when testing performance, it is generally recommended that `--max-num-seqs` * `--data-parallel-size` >= the actual total concurrency.\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` is the maximum number of tokens processed in one scheduler step. A larger value can improve prefill efficiency but consumes more activation memory.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size` sets the global number of data parallel ranks, while `--tensor-parallel-size` sets the tensor parallel size within each DP rank. Configure them together according to the deployment topology and available NPUs.\n"
"- `--enable-expert-parallel` enables expert parallelism for MoE layers. Do not mix MoE tensor parallelism and expert parallelism in the same MoE layer.\n"
"- `--no-enable-prefix-caching` indicates that prefix caching is disabled. To enable it, remove this option.\n"
"- `--block-size` sets the KV cache block size. To enable the experimental 4k prefix cache hit support, change it from `128` to `32`.\n"
"- `--quantization ascend` enables Ascend quantization for the W8A8 model.\n"
"- `--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc` enables 4-bit TurboQuant quantization for DeepSeek-V4's Compress-4 attention KV cache to reduce memory usage. It is suited to ultra-long-context workloads such as AI coding, especially when KV cache memory limits concurrency. It is independent of weight and indexer cache quantization and requires compatible TurboQuant and fused attention operators. P/D disaggregated deployments are not currently supported.\n"
"- `--speculative-config` configures speculative decoding to accelerate inference. Use `mtp` for Multi-Token Prediction (MTP) and `dspark` for DSpark models. When using DSpark, `num_speculative_tokens` must be at least 5 (check the checkpoint's `config.json`).\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` enables full ACL graph execution in the decode phase to reduce scheduling latency.\n"
"- `--additional-config` enables Ascend-specific optimizations. `enable_npugraph_ex` enables enhanced ACL graph execution, `enable_static_kernel: false` keeps static-kernel compilation disabled, `enable_cpu_binding` enables Ascend-native CPU binding, `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` overlaps shared expert computation for better MoE throughput.\n"
"- `VLLM_PREFIX_CACHE_RETENTION_INTERVAL`: Controls the retention interval, in tokens, for prefix-cache checkpoints of hybrid attention layers. It is applicable to DeepSeek-V4 and takes effect only when prefix caching is enabled. Under KV-cache pressure, it can improve the effective prefix-cache hit rate for reusable long prefixes. The value must be a non-negative multiple of `--block-size`; for DeepSeek-V4-Flash, 128 times `--block-size` is recommended. Set it to `4096` when `--block-size` is `32`, or `16384` when `--block-size` is `128`."
msgstr ""
"- `--max-model-len` 指定最大上下文长度，即单个请求的输入 token 与输出 token 之和。请根据实际场景进行调整。\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs` 表示每个 DP 组允许处理的最大请求数。如果发送到服务的请求数超过此限制，超出的请求将保持等待状态，不会被调度。请注意，等待状态所耗费的时间也会计入 TTFT 和 TPOT 等指标。因此，在测试性能时，通常建议 `--max-num-seqs` * `--data-parallel-size` >= 实际总并发数。\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` 是单个调度步骤中处理的最大 token 数。较大的值可以提高 prefill 效率，但会消耗更多激活内存。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size` 设置全局数据并行 rank 数，而 `--tensor-parallel-size` 设置每个 DP rank 内的张量并行大小。请根据部署拓扑和可用 NPU 一起配置它们。\n"
"- `--enable-expert-parallel` 为 MoE 层启用专家并行。请勿在同一 MoE 层中混用 MoE 张量并行和专家并行。\n"
"- `--no-enable-prefix-caching` 表示禁用前缀缓存。如需启用，请移除此选项。\n"
"- `--block-size` 设置 KV cache 块大小。如需启用实验性的 4k 前缀缓存命中支持，请将其从 `128` 改为 `32`。\n"
"- `--quantization ascend` 为 W8A8 模型启用昇腾量化。\n"
"- `--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc` 为 DeepSeek-V4 的 Compress-4 注意力 KV cache 启用 4 位 TurboQuant 量化，以减少内存占用。它适用于 AI 编码等超长上下文工作负载，尤其是在 KV cache 内存限制并发数的情况下。它独立于权重和索引器缓存量化，并且需要兼容的 TurboQuant 和融合注意力算子。目前不支持 P/D 分离部署。\n"
"- `--speculative-config` 配置投机解码以加速推理。使用 `mtp` 表示多 Token 预测（MTP），使用 `dspark` 表示 DSpark 模型。使用 DSpark 时，`num_speculative_tokens` 必须至少为 5（请查看 checkpoint 的 `config.json`）。\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` 在 decode 阶段启用完整的 ACL graph 执行，以降低调度延迟。\n"
"- `--additional-config` 启用昇腾特有的优化。`enable_npugraph_ex` 启用增强的 ACL graph 执行，`enable_static_kernel: false` 保持静态 kernel 编译禁用，`enable_cpu_binding` 启用昇腾原生 CPU 绑定，`multistream_overlap_shared_expert` 重叠共享专家计算以获得更好的 MoE 吞吐量。\n"
"- `VLLM_PREFIX_CACHE_RETENTION_INTERVAL`：控制混合注意力层前缀缓存检查点的保留间隔（以 token 为单位）。它适用于 DeepSeek-V4，并且仅在启用前缀缓存时生效。在 KV cache 压力下，它可以提高可复用长前缀的有效前缀缓存命中率。该值必须是非负的 `--block-size` 倍数；对于 DeepSeek-V4-Flash，建议为 `--block-size` 的 128 倍。当 `--block-size` 为 `32` 时将其设置为 `4096`，当 `--block-size` 为 `128` 时将其设置为 `16384`。"

msgid ""
"Service Verification:\n"
"Use the API port configured for the selected deployment. For the 950DT example, use port `8000`."
msgstr ""
"服务验证：\n"
"使用为所选部署配置的 API 端口。对于 950DT 示例，请使用端口 `8000`。"

msgid "### 5.2 PD Separation Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.2 PD 分离部署"

msgid ""
"PD (Prefill-Decode) separation addresses these issues by running Prefill and"
" Decode on dedicated NPU groups, each configured independently, on one or "
"more nodes. This architecture is recommended for production deployments with"
" concurrent multi-user workloads, where stable latency and high throughput "
"are both required."
msgstr ""
"PD（Prefill-Decode）分离通过在一个或多个节点上，将 Prefill 和 Decode 运行在各自独立配置的专用 NPU "
"组上，来解决这些问题。对于需要同时满足稳定延迟和高吞吐量的并发多用户工作负载的生产部署，推荐采用此架构。"

msgid ""
"The following sections describe multi-node PD separation deployment on Atlas"
" 800I A3 (128GB × 8) and Atlas 800I A2 (64GB × 8), and single-node PD "
"separation on 950DT products (96GB × 8)."
msgstr ""
"以下各节介绍在 Atlas 800I A3（128GB × 8）和 Atlas 800I A2（64GB × 8）上的多节点 PD 分离部署，以及在 "
"Ascend 950DT系列产品（96GB × 8）上的单节点 PD 分离部署。"

msgid "For MTP (`A3 series`), use DP4, TP1 and PCP4:"
msgstr "对于 MTP（`A3 系列`），请使用 DP4、TP1 和 PCP4："

msgid ""
"- `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` keeps the hybrid KV cache manager enabled. DeepSeek-V4 KV Pool deployments require this flag; otherwise, the service may OOM during startup.\n"
"- `--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc` is not currently supported in P/D disaggregated deployments.\n"
"- `--enforce-eager` forces eager execution on prefill nodes instead of graph compilation.\n"
"- `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1`: Enables Model Runner V2. Set it with `export VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1` on both DSpark nodes in the A3 example.\n"
"- `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` and `decode.dp_size/tp_size` must match the actual global DP and TP layout on the prefill and decode sides.\n"
"- `recompute_scheduler_enable: true`: enables the recomputation scheduler. When the KV Cache of the decode node is insufficient, requests will be sent to the prefill node to recompute the KV Cache. In the PD separation scenario, enable this configuration only on decode nodes.\n"
"- `speculative-config`: When DSpark is enabled, Prefill and Decode must use the same number of speculative tokens, and `num_speculative_tokens` must be at least 5 (check the checkpoint's `config.json`). For MTP, we recommend setting Prefill to 1 and Decode to the actual number of speculative tokens.\n"
"- `MooncakeHybridConnector`: the KV transfer connector used for PD separation, transferring KV Cache between prefill and decode nodes.\n"
"- `enable_shared_expert_dp: true`: enables data parallelism for shared experts, applicable to MoE models.\n"
"- `VLLM_PREFIX_CACHE_RETENTION_INTERVAL`: Controls the retention interval, in tokens, for prefix-cache checkpoints of hybrid attention layers. It is applicable to DeepSeek-V4 and takes effect only when prefix caching is enabled. Under KV-cache pressure, it can improve the effective prefix-cache hit rate for reusable long prefixes. The value must be a non-negative multiple of `--block-size`; for DeepSeek-V4-Flash, 128 times `--block-size` is recommended. Set it to `4096` when `--block-size` is `32`, or `16384` when `--block-size` is `128`.\n"
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`: Enables the fused MoE computation (MC2) optimization, which consolidates shared expert and routed expert computation into fused kernels to reduce launch overhead and improve MoE inference throughput.\n"
"- `cudagraph_capture_sizes` (inside `--compilation-config`): Batch size tiers for ACL graph capture in Decode phase. vLLM pre-compiles graphs for these batch sizes to avoid runtime compilation overhead. In DSpark mode (`num_speculative_tokens=5`), each sequence processes 6 tokens per step (1 real + 5 speculative), so actual concurrency ≈ `batch_size / 6` (e.g., 360 → 60 concurrency). If unset, vLLM auto-captures on demand; set explicitly when concurrency patterns are predictable."
msgstr ""
"- `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` 保持混合 KV cache 管理器启用。DeepSeek-V4 KV Pool 部署需要此标志；否则，服务在启动时可能发生 OOM。\n"
"- `--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc` 目前在 P/D 分离部署中不受支持。\n"
"- `--enforce-eager` 强制 prefill 节点使用 eager 执行，而非图编译。\n"
"- `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1`：启用 Model Runner V2。在 A3 示例中的两个 DSpark 节点上通过 `export VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1` 设置。\n"
"- `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` 和 `decode.dp_size/tp_size` 必须与 prefill 侧和 decode 侧实际的全局 DP 和 TP 布局相匹配。\n"
"- `recompute_scheduler_enable: true`：启用重计算调度器。当 decode 节点的 KV Cache 不足时，请求将被发送到 prefill 节点以重新计算 KV Cache。在 PD 分离场景中，仅在 decode 节点上启用此配置。\n"
"- `speculative-config`：启用 DSpark 时，Prefill 和 Decode 必须使用相同数量的投机 token，且 `num_speculative_tokens` 必须至少为 5（请查看 checkpoint 的 `config.json`）。对于 MTP，我们建议将 Prefill 设置为 1，Decode 设置为实际的投机 token 数量。\n"
"- `MooncakeHybridConnector`：用于 PD 分离的 KV 传输连接器，在 prefill 和 decode 节点之间传输 KV Cache。\n"
"- `enable_shared_expert_dp: true`：启用共享专家的数据并行，适用于 MoE 模型。\n"
"- `VLLM_PREFIX_CACHE_RETENTION_INTERVAL`：控制混合注意力层前缀缓存检查点的保留间隔（以 token 为单位）。它适用于 DeepSeek-V4，且仅在启用前缀缓存时生效。在 KV cache 压力下，它可以提高可复用长前缀的有效前缀缓存命中率。该值必须是非负的 `--block-size` 倍数；对于 DeepSeek-V4-Flash，建议设置为 `--block-size` 的 128 倍。当 `--block-size` 为 `32` 时设置为 `4096`，当 `--block-size` 为 `128` 时设置为 `16384`。\n"
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`：启用融合 MoE 计算（MC2）优化，该优化将共享专家和路由专家计算整合到融合内核中，以减少启动开销并提高 MoE 推理吞吐量。\n"
"- `cudagraph_capture_sizes`（位于 `--compilation-config` 内）：Decode 阶段 ACL 图捕获的批大小层级。vLLM 会为这些批大小预编译图，以避免运行时编译开销。在 DSpark 模式（`num_speculative_tokens=5`）下，每个序列每步处理 6 个 token（1 个真实 + 5 个投机），因此实际并发数 ≈ `batch_size / 6`（例如，360 → 60 并发）。如果未设置，vLLM 会按需自动捕获；当并发模式可预测时，请显式设置。"

msgid ""
"#### 5.2.4 950DT products PD Separation Deployment {: #524-950dt-series-pd-"
"separation-deployment }"
msgstr ""
"#### 5.2.4 Ascend 950DT系列产品 PD 分离部署 {: #524-950dt-series-pd-separation-"
"deployment }"

msgid ""
"This section describes PD separation on a single 950DT products node (96GB ×"
" 8). The Prefill instance uses DP1/TP1 with PCP4 on NPUs 0–3, while the "
"Decode instances use DP4/TP1 with PCP1 on NPUs 4–7. KV Cache is transferred "
"from Prefill to Decode using MooncakeConnectorV2."
msgstr ""
"本节介绍在单个 Ascend 950DT系列产品节点（96GB × 8）上的 PD 分离。Prefill 实例在 NPU 0–3 上使用 DP1/TP1"
" 和 PCP4，而 Decode 实例在 NPU 4–7 上使用 DP4/TP1 和 PCP1。KV Cache 通过 "
"MooncakeConnectorV2 从 Prefill 传输到 Decode。"

msgid ""
"You can adjust the Prefill and Decode parallelism according to your workload"
" and service requirements. The prefill and decode parallelism settings in "
"--kv-transfer-config must match the actual engine configurations."
msgstr ""
"您可以根据工作负载和服务需求调整 Prefill 和 Decode 的并行度。`--kv-transfer-config` 中的 prefill 和 "
"decode 并行度设置必须与实际引擎配置相匹配。"

msgid ""
"Before starting the services, set VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1 in both "
"templates to enable Model Runner V2. Replace nic_name, local_ip, and the "
"model path with the appropriate values for your environment."
msgstr ""
"在启动服务之前，请在两个模板中设置 `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1` 以启用 Model Runner V2。请将 "
"`nic_name`、`local_ip` 和模型路径替换为您环境中的相应值。"

msgid ""
"Both Prefill and Decode use the same node IP (`<node_ip>`). The Prefill DP "
"group uses RPC port `12321`, while the Decode DP group uses RPC port "
"`12325`."
msgstr ""
"Prefill 和 Decode 使用相同的节点 IP（`<node_ip>`）。Prefill DP 组使用 RPC 端口 `12321`，而 "
"Decode DP 组使用 RPC 端口 `12325`。"

msgid ""
"1. Prepare one shared `launch_online_dp.py` launcher for Prefill and Decode."
msgstr "1. 为 Prefill 和 Decode 准备一个共享的 `launch_online_dp.py` 启动器。"

msgid ""
"Select the startup script with `--script`. When `--dp-size` is `1`, the "
"launcher filters DP rank and external/hybrid load-balancing flags before "
"running the script. It also propagates pipeline failures through `pipefail`."
msgstr ""
"使用 `--script` 选择启动脚本。当 `--dp-size` 为 `1` 时，启动器会在运行脚本之前过滤 DP rank "
"以及外部/混合负载均衡标志。它还会通过 `pipefail` 传播管道故障。"

msgid "| Parameter | Type | Required | Default | Description |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 类型 | 是否必需 | 默认值 | 描述 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--script` | str | Yes | — | Path to the Prefill or Decode startup "
"script. |"
msgstr "    | `--script` | str | 是 | — | Prefill 或 Decode 启动脚本的路径。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--dp-size` | int | Yes | — | Total number of DP ranks across all "
"nodes. |"
msgstr "    | `--dp-size` | int | 是 | — | 所有节点上的 DP rank 总数。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--tp-size` | int | No | `1` | Tensor parallel size for each DP rank. "
"|"
msgstr "    | `--tp-size` | int | 否 | `1` | 每个 DP rank 的张量并行大小。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--pcp-size` | int | No | `1` | Prefill context parallel size. Each "
"local DP rank is assigned `--tp-size` × `--pcp-size` devices. |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--pcp-size` | int | 否 | `1` | Prefill 上下文并行大小。每个本地 DP rank 分配 `--tp-"
"size` × `--pcp-size` 个设备。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--dp-size-local` | int | No | `--dp-size` | Number of DP ranks "
"launched on the current node. |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--dp-size-local` | int | 否 | `--dp-size` | 在当前节点上启动的 DP rank 数量。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--dp-rank-start` | int | No | `0` | Starting DP rank for the current "
"node. |"
msgstr "    | `--dp-rank-start` | int | 否 | `0` | 当前节点的起始 DP rank。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--dp-address` | str | Yes | — | IP address of the DP master node. |"
msgstr "    | `--dp-address` | str | 是 | — | DP 主节点的 IP 地址。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--dp-rpc-port` | str | No | `12345` | RPC port for DP coordination. |"
msgstr "    | `--dp-rpc-port` | str | 否 | `12345` | 用于 DP 协调的 RPC 端口。 |"

msgid ""
