msgid ""
"| Startup order | Decode → Prefill → Proxy | MetaService → Decode → Prefill "
"→ Proxy |"
msgstr ""
"| 启动顺序 | Decode → Prefill → Proxy | MetaService → Decode → Prefill → Proxy |"

msgid ""
"| Verification | Confirm P-to-D KV transfer | Also confirm an external KV "
"Cache Pool hit with a repeated prefix |"
msgstr "| 验证 | 确认 P 到 D 的 KV 传输 | 还需使用重复前缀确认外部 KV Cache Pool 命中 |"

msgid "1. Prerequisites"
msgstr "1. 前提条件"

msgid ""
"Configure the Memcache environment and configuration files inside the "
"container where both Prefill and Decode run. Then, open separate terminals "
"in the same container to launch Prefill on NPUs 0–3 and Decode on NPUs 4–7."
msgstr ""
"在运行 Prefill 和 Decode 的容器内配置 Memcache 环境和配置文件。然后，在同一容器中打开多个独立终端，在 NPU 0–3 上启动"
" Prefill，在 NPU 4–7 上启动 Decode。"

msgid ""
"Replace the paths below with the actual values in your environment. "
"`INSTALL_PATH` is the `Location` reported by `pip show memcache_hybrid`. Set"
" `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` to the absolute path of `mmc-local.conf`. Export "
"the environment variables so they are inherited by the launcher and its "
"child processes. Run these exports in each Prefill and Decode terminal "
"before starting the corresponding launcher."
msgstr ""
"请将下面的路径替换为环境中的实际值。`INSTALL_PATH` 是 `pip show memcache_hybrid` 报告的 "
"`Location`。将 `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` 设置为 `mmc-local.conf` "
"的绝对路径。导出这些环境变量，以便启动器及其子进程继承它们。在启动相应的启动器之前，请在每个 Prefill 和 Decode 终端中运行这些导出命令。"

msgid "Configure one `mmc-meta.conf` for the MetaService:"
msgstr "为 MetaService 配置一个 `mmc-meta.conf`："

msgid "Configure `mmc-local.conf` for both roles on this node:"
msgstr "为此节点上的两个角色配置 `mmc-local.conf`："

msgid ""
"Use `device_urma` for 950DT products Device UB. For UBOE, replace it with "
"`device_uboe`. Both roles must connect to the same MetaService and "
"ConfigStore. `world_size` is the maximum number of LocalServices supported "
"by the pool; it is not the number of NPUs used by this example."
msgstr ""
"对于 Ascend 950DT系列产品的 Device UB，请使用 `device_urma`。对于 UBOE，请将其替换为 "
"`device_uboe`。两个角色都必须连接到同一个 MetaService 和 ConfigStore。`world_size` 是池支持的最大 "
"LocalService 数量，而不是本示例使用的 NPU 数量。"

msgid ""
"This example uses the embedded LocalService mode. Each vLLM process "
"initializes a LocalService by loading `mmc-local.conf` from "
"`MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH`. Therefore, `ock.mmc.local_service.dram.size` must "
"be greater than `0GB`. Do not start a separate standalone LocalService when "
"using this configuration."
msgstr ""
"本示例使用嵌入式 LocalService 模式。每个 vLLM 进程通过从 `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` 加载 `mmc-"
"local.conf` 来初始化 LocalService。因此，`ock.mmc.local_service.dram.size` 必须大于 "
"`0GB`。使用此配置时，请勿单独启动独立的 LocalService。"

msgid ""
"In this example, the Prefill instance uses PCP4 together with "
"`AscendStoreConnector` in layerwise mode. This example sets `use_layerwise` "
"to `true` and `layerwise_prefetch_layers` to `3`."
msgstr ""
"在本示例中，Prefill 实例使用 PCP4，并结合 layerwise 模式下的 `AscendStoreConnector`。本示例将 "
"`use_layerwise` 设置为 `true`，将 `layerwise_prefetch_layers` 设置为 `3`。"

msgid "1. Prefill script: `run_prefill_memcache.sh`"
msgstr "1. Prefill 脚本：`run_prefill_memcache.sh`"

msgid ""
"Save the following template as `run_prefill_memcache.sh` in the same "
"directory as the shared `launch_online_dp.py`."
msgstr "将以下模板保存为 `run_prefill_memcache.sh`，放在共享的 `launch_online_dp.py` 所在目录中。"

msgid "2. Decode script: `run_decode_memcache.sh`"
msgstr "2. Decode 脚本：`run_decode_memcache.sh`"

msgid ""
"Save the following template as `run_decode_memcache.sh` in the same "
"directory as the shared `launch_online_dp.py`. It accepts the same eight "
"arguments, maps device indices to NPUs `4`–`7`, and writes a separate log "
"for each DP rank."
msgstr ""
"将以下模板保存为 `run_decode_memcache.sh`，放在共享的 `launch_online_dp.py` "
"所在目录中。它接受相同的八个参数，将设备索引映射到 NPU `4`–`7`，并为每个 DP rank 写入单独的日志。"

msgid "3. Start and Verify the Services"
msgstr "3. 启动并验证服务"

msgid "1. Start one MetaService on the node containing `mmc-meta.conf`:"
msgstr "1. 在包含 `mmc-meta.conf` 的节点上启动一个 MetaService："

msgid ""
"After the MetaService is ready, start Decode and Prefill in separate "
"terminals in the same container, in this order: Decode → Prefill → P-D "
"proxy. Before starting Prefill, wait for all four Decode API endpoints to "
"become healthy."
msgstr ""
"MetaService 就绪后，在同一容器的不同终端中按以下顺序启动 Decode 和 Prefill：Decode → Prefill → P-D "
"代理。启动 Prefill 之前，请等待所有四个 Decode API 端点变为健康状态。"

msgid ""
"2. Start Decode and Prefill in separate terminals in the same container. Run"
" both commands from the directory containing the shared launcher and the "
"pooled scripts. Replace `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` with the directory prepared "
"above. Both roles use the same node IP but different DP RPC ports."
msgstr ""
"2. 在同一容器的不同终端中启动 Decode 和 Prefill。请在包含共享启动器和池化脚本的目录中运行这两个命令。将 "
"`MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` 替换为上文准备的目录。两个角色使用相同的节点 IP，但使用不同的 DP RPC 端口。"

msgid "2. Prefill (NPUs 0–3), after all four Decode API endpoints are healthy"
msgstr "2. Prefill（NPU 0–3），在所有四个 Decode API 端点健康之后"

msgid ""
"3. Start the Proxy and Verify KV Cache Pool Reuse\n"
"        Use the proxy configuration from [Section 5.2.4](#524-950dt-series-pd-separation-deployment) and send a generation request to `<proxy_ip>:1999` as described in [Section 6](#6-functional-verification). Confirm that the response contains generated text."
msgstr ""
"3. 启动代理并验证 KV Cache Pool 复用\n"
"        使用 [5.2.4 节](#524-950dt-series-pd-separation-deployment)中的代理配置，并按照 [第 6 节](#6-functional-verification)所述向 `<proxy_ip>:1999` 发送生成请求。确认响应中包含生成的文本。"

msgid ""
"To verify KV Cache Pool reuse, send an initial request to warm up the cache,"
" then send another request with the same identical token prefix. Check the "
"Prefill logs for KV Pool lookup/get/put operations and cache-hit "
"information. An HTTP 200 response alone does not confirm KV Cache Pool "
"reuse. For details,refer to [KV Cache Pool (Ascend "
"Store)](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-"
"backend)."
msgstr ""
"要验证 KV Cache Pool 复用，请先发送一个初始请求以预热缓存，然后发送另一个具有相同 token 前缀的请求。检查 Prefill 日志中的"
" KV Pool 查找/获取/写入操作以及缓存命中信息。仅凭 HTTP 200 响应并不能确认 KV Cache Pool 复用。详情请参阅 [KV "
"Cache Pool (Ascend "
"Store)](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-"
"backend)。"

msgid ""
"This section verifies basic inference functionality for all deployment "
"modes. For Memcache pooled PD deployments, also verify external KV Cache "
"Pool reuse using the [A3 startup and verification steps](#534-startup-and-"
"verification) or the “Start the Proxy and Verify KV Cache Pool Reuse” step "
"in the [950DT example](#54-950dt-single-node-pd-separation-deployment)."
msgstr ""
"本节验证所有部署模式的基本推理功能。对于 Memcache 池化 PD 部署，还需使用 [A3 启动与验证步骤](#534-startup-and-"
"verification)或 [950DT 示例](#54-950dt-single-node-pd-separation-"
"deployment)中的“启动代理并验证 KV Cache Pool 复用”步骤来验证外部 KV Cache Pool 复用。"

msgid ""
"A: For 950PR&950DT products, the W4A4C8 weights of `DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731` "
"are quantized with "
"[msmodelslim](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msmodelslim/blob/master/lab_practice/deepseek_v4/deepseek_v4_flash_w4a4c8.yaml)."
" To preserve accuracy at such a low bit-width, a mixed-precision strategy is"
" used: only the modules that dominate the parameter count are quantized to 4"
" bit, while precision-sensitive modules fall back to higher precision or are"
" not quantized at all."
msgstr ""
"答：对于 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品，`DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731` 的 W4A4C8 权重使用 "
"[msmodelslim](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msmodelslim/blob/master/lab_practice/deepseek_v4/deepseek_v4_flash_w4a4c8.yaml)"
" 进行量化。为了在如此低的位宽下保持精度，采用了混合精度策略：仅将参数数量占主导的模块量化为 4 "
"bit，而对精度敏感的模块则回退到更高精度或完全不量化。"

msgid ""
"- **Quantization algorithm**: The weights and activations use the MXFP4/MXFP8 microscaling formats. Each tensor is divided into blocks of 32 elements, and each block shares a single scaling factor obtained with symmetric min-max calibration on a mixed calibration dataset. Block-wise scaling adapts to the local dynamic range of each tensor, so the quantization error is far lower than that of uniform INT4 quantization.\n"
"- **C8 (FP8 KV cache)**: C8 is a dynamic quantization applied to the KV cache during inference. On 950PR&950DT products, the KV cache is quantized to FP8 (not INT8). It is unrelated to the parameters stored in the weight checkpoint and is controlled only by the serving configuration. DeepSeek-V4-Flash and DeepSeek-V4-Pro share exactly the same C8 scheme:\n"
"    - **Attention KV cache** (FP8 by default on 950PR&950DT products; switch back to BF16 with `--kv-cache-dtype bfloat16`): the compressed KV latent, which serves as both K and V, is dynamically quantized per 64-element tile to FP8 (E4M3) with a shared E8M0 scale per tile; the RoPE part of the KV cache stays in BF16, and Q is not quantized.\n"
"    - **Indexer cache** (enabled with `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8`): both indexer Q and K are first rotated by a Hadamard matrix to spread outliers, and then dynamically quantized per token to FP8 (E4M3) with per-token FP32 scales."
msgstr ""
"- **量化算法**：权重和激活使用 MXFP4/MXFP8 微缩放格式。每个张量被划分为 32 个元素的块，每个块共享一个缩放因子，该因子通过在混合校准数据集上进行对称 min-max 校准获得。逐块缩放可适应每个张量的局部动态范围，因此量化误差远低于均匀 INT4 量化。\n"
"- **C8（FP8 KV cache）**：C8 是在推理期间应用于 KV cache 的动态量化。在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品上，KV cache 被量化为 FP8（而非 INT8）。它与权重检查点中存储的参数无关，仅由服务配置控制。DeepSeek-V4-Flash 和 DeepSeek-V4-Pro 共享完全相同的 C8 方案：\n"
"    - **Attention KV cache**（在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品上默认使用 FP8；可通过 `--kv-cache-dtype bfloat16` 切换回 BF16）：作为 K 和 V 的压缩 KV latent，按 64 元素 tile 动态量化为 FP8（E4M3），每个 tile 共享一个 E8M0 缩放因子；KV cache 的 RoPE 部分保持 BF16，Q 不量化。\n"
"    - **Indexer cache**（通过 `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8` 启用）：indexer 的 Q 和 K 首先经过 Hadamard 矩阵旋转以分散离群值，然后按 token 动态量化为 FP8（E4M3），并使用逐 token 的 FP32 缩放因子。"
